. \`Nh\u00e0 ga \u1edf ph\u00eda b\u1eafc. Ch\u1ee3 \u1edf ph\u00eda nam. Bu\u1ed5i s\u00e1ng, m\u1eb7t tr\u1eddi m\u1ecdc \u1edf ph\u00eda \u0111\u00f4ng, tr\u00ean m\u00e1i nh\u1eefng ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0. Bu\u1ed5i chi\u1ec1u, m\u1eb7t tr\u1eddi l\u1eb7n \u1edf ph\u00eda t\u00e2y.\``},{`en`:`\`[[Now]] [[go]] [[out]] [[and]] [[find]] [[three]] [[things|thing]],\` [[says|say]] Ngan. \`[[One]]: [[something]] [[opposite]] [[number]] 3. [[Two]]: [[something]] [[near]] [[the]] [[station]]. [[Three]]: [[something]] [[far]] [[away]], [[at]] [[the]] [[south]] [[end]] [[of]] [[the]] [[street]].\``,`vn`:`\`Gi\u1edd c\u00e1c em ra ngo\u00e0i v\u00e0 t\u00ecm ba th\u1ee9,\` ch\u1ecb Ng\u00e2n n\u00f3i. \`M\u1ed9t: m\u1ed9t th\u1ee9 \u1edf \u0111\u1ed1i di\u1ec7n s\u1ed1 3. Hai: m\u1ed9t th\u1ee9 \u1edf g\u1ea7n nh\u00e0 ga. Ba: m\u1ed9t th\u1ee9 \u1edf th\u1eadt xa, t\u1eadn \u0111\u1ea7u ph\u00eda nam c\u1ee7a ph\u1ed1.\``},{`en`:`Tin's [[team]] [[runs|run]] [[out]] [[first]], [[very]] [[fast]]. \`Tin!\` [[shouts|shout]] Ngoc. \`[[The]] [[station]] [[is|be]] [[north]]! [[You]] [[are|be]] [[going|go]] [[south]]!\` Tin's [[team]] [[turns|turn]] [[around]] [[and]] [[runs|run]] [[back]] [[past]] [[them]].`,`vn`:`\u0110\u1ed9i c\u1ee7a T\u00edn lao ra \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, ch\u1ea1y r\u1ea5t nhanh. \`T\u00edn \u01a1i!\` Ng\u1ecdc h\u00e9t. \`Nh\u00e0 ga \u1edf ph\u00eda b\u1eafc! C\u00e1c c\u1eadu \u0111ang ch\u1ea1y v\u1ec1 ph\u00eda nam \u0111\u1ea5y!\` \u0110\u1ed9i T\u00edn quay ngo\u1eaft l\u1ea1i, ch\u1ea1y v\u1ee5t qua m\u1eb7t h\u1ecd.`},{`en`:`Ngoc's [[team]] [[walks|walk]] [[across]] [[the]] [[street]] [[with]] Dat's [[map]]. [[Opposite]] [[number]] 3 [[is|be]] [[number]] 4. [[There]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[radio]] [[in]] [[a]] [[window]] [[above]] [[the]] [[door]]. \`[[Thing]] [[one]]: [[the]] [[radio]]!\` [[says|say]] Ngoc. [[She]] [[takes|take]] [[a]] [[photo]]. \`[[Smile]], [[everyone]]!\``,`vn`:`\u0110\u1ed9i c\u1ee7a Ng\u1ecdc c\u1ea7m b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 c\u1ee7a \